TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution, 100 C, pe 4, pH 5
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5 charge
    pe 4
    C(4) 0.5e-3
    Mn 1e-3
    units mol/kgw
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 10.0 0.001
        -steps 10 in 100
        -tol 1e-12
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel_calcite.csv
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -pe true
END